---
// 본문 인라인 도해(정적 SVG). 회전 축에 따른 무게중심 이동 3단 비교.
// 박스 W×H = 96×80, 상단 y=50 → 박스 중심 y=90, ▲ 무게중심 y=50+80×2/3≈103.33.
// ② 박스 중심 회전: 무게중심 y=130-53.33≈76.67 / ③ 무게중심 회전: 박스가 y 76.67~156.67 로 이동.
---

<figure class="demo cd-demo">
  <svg
    class="cd-svg"
    viewBox="0 36 560 182"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="cd-title"
  >
    <title id="cd-title">
      박스 중심으로 회전하면 무게중심이 높이의 1/3 만큼 이동하고, 무게중심으로 회전하면 제자리에 머문다
    </title>

    <!-- 접힘 전 ▲ 무게중심 높이 -->
    <line class="cd-guide" x1="16" y1="103.33" x2="544" y2="103.33" />

    <!-- ① 원래 모양 -->
    <g>
      <rect class="cd-bbox" x="52" y="50" width="96" height="80" />
      <polygon class="cd-tri" points="100,50 52,130 148,130" />
      <path class="cd-cross cd-cross--muted" d="M94 90h12M100 84v12" />
      <circle class="cd-dot" cx="100" cy="103.33" r="4.5" />

      <path class="cd-bracket" d="M36 50h6M39 50v53.33M36 103.33h6M39 103.33v26.67M36 130h6" />
      <text class="cd-dim" x="33" y="80" text-anchor="end">2H/3</text>
      <text class="cd-dim" x="33" y="121" text-anchor="end">H/3</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ② 박스 중심으로 회전 -->
    <g>
      <rect class="cd-bbox" x="232" y="50" width="96" height="80" />
      <polygon class="cd-tri" points="232,50 328,50 280,130" />
      <circle class="cd-ghost" cx="280" cy="103.33" r="4.5" />
      <path class="cd-cross" d="M272 90h16M280 82v16" />
      <circle class="cd-dot" cx="280" cy="76.67" r="4.5" />

      <path class="cd-bracket" d="M338 76.67h6M341 76.67v26.66M338 103.33h6" />
      <text class="cd-dim cd-dim--accent" x="349" y="94">H/3</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ③ 무게중심으로 회전 -->
    <g>
      <rect class="cd-bbox cd-bbox--ghost" x="412" y="50" width="96" height="80" />
      <rect class="cd-bbox" x="412" y="76.67" width="96" height="80" />
      <polygon class="cd-tri" points="412,76.67 508,76.67 460,156.67" />
      <path class="cd-cross" d="M450 103.33h20M460 93.33v20" />
      <circle class="cd-dot" cx="460" cy="103.33" r="4.5" />
    </g>

    <text class="cd-cap" x="100" y="188" text-anchor="middle">① 원래 모양 ▲</text>
    <text class="cd-cap" x="280" y="188" text-anchor="middle">② 박스 중심으로 회전</text>
    <text class="cd-sub" x="280" y="208" text-anchor="middle">무게중심이 위로 이동</text>
    <text class="cd-cap" x="460" y="188" text-anchor="middle">③ 무게중심으로 회전</text>
    <text class="cd-sub" x="460" y="208" text-anchor="middle">무게중심 제자리, 박스가 이동</text>
  </svg>

  <figcaption class="cd-legend">
    <span><i class="cd-key cd-key--dot"></i>무게중심</span>
    <span><i class="cd-key cd-key--cross"></i>회전 축</span>
    <span><i class="cd-key cd-key--box"></i>요소 박스(border box)</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style lang="scss">
  .cd-demo {
    margin: rem(24) 0;
    padding: rem(24) rem(14) rem(20);
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border: 1px solid #e3e3e3;
    border-radius: rem(7);
    color: #3b3e49;
  }

  .cd-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: rem(560);
    height: auto;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .cd-guide {
    stroke: #f43f5e;
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .cd-bbox {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #9a9aa3;
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;

    &--ghost {
      stroke: #d3d3d8;
    }
  }

  .cd-tri {
    fill: #dcdee5;
  }

  .cd-cross {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #2563eb;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;

    &--muted {
      stroke: #9a9aa3;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }
  }

  .cd-dot {
    fill: #f43f5e;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cd-ghost {
    fill: #fff;
    stroke: #f43f5e;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 2 2;
  }

  .cd-bracket {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #9a9aa3;
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .cd-dim {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #777;

    &--accent {
      fill: #f43f5e;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  }

  .cd-cap {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: #222;
  }

  .cd-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #777;
  }

  .cd-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.3rem 1.1rem;
    margin-top: rem(14);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #666;

    span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }

  .cd-key {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;

    &--dot {
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #f43f5e;
    }
    &--cross {
      background:
        linear-gradient(#2563eb, #2563eb) center / 100% 2px no-repeat,
        linear-gradient(#2563eb, #2563eb) center / 2px 100% no-repeat;
    }
    &--box {
      border: 1px dashed #9a9aa3;
    }
  }
</style>
